\(m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\\)</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}covering\\text{-}meager\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringMeagerNumber}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal A|\\mid\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\land\\bigl[\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{Meager}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr]\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal A=\\mathbb R\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}covering\\text{-}meager\\text{-}number} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCiCoveringMeagerNumber}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\kappa=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal A|\\mid\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\mathbb R)\\land\\bigl[\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mathrm{Meager}(A,\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\bigr]\\land\\bigcup\\mathcal A=\\mathbb R\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-meager","status":"resolved","id":"d816c9cae96d1191","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-meager]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d